//     set; otherwise the hart sets the bit in the PTE. menvcfg.ADUE selects hardware updating when
//     Svadu is implemented (menvcfg_adue_op); it is set through T-SBI and read back. With ADUE=1
//     the update is required. If ADUE could be set (Svadu), ADUE=0 selects Svade, so the access
//     must fault. If ADUE is read-only 0, either scheme is accepted. In every case the outcome must
